+ * Copyright (c) 2008 Alexander Strange (astrange@ithinksw.com)
+ *
+ * Many thanks to Steven M. Schultz for providing clever ideas and
+ * to Michael Niedermayer <michaelni@gmx.at> for writing initial
+ * implementation.
